{"parse": {"title": "TTSC-07", "pageid": 134762, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-06\" title=\"TTSC-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTSC-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-08\" title=\"TTSC-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTSC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A2.A8.E8.A5.BF.E5.93.A5.E5.BC.8F.E5.A5.87.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"墨西哥式奇物\">墨西哥式奇物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 墨西哥式奇物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Mexican Souvenir</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>务<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>收<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3510107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>傍晚，太阳散发着最后的余温。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街巷深处，一家热闹的小店内，匠人们正手工制作着节庆用的糖果头骨。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>野木蓝，手脚利落些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>当初要不是你求着我，说你可以在每天晚上把剩下的工作都做完，我的工坊才不会收你这样的年轻人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>你得赶在明日之前，将这些糖果都送到迪亚哥家里去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>好的。我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>对了，罗马区的华雷斯女士想你抽空过去一趟，给她重新绘制家族墓地的墓碑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-640301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>噢该死，我忘记了，天黑前还得去一趟克里斯蒂娜那儿，收些万寿菊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主马不停蹄地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645622.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645622.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>今晚……还有一百多个糖果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天色越来越暗，匠人们也逐渐离开。昏沉的烛光下，只有他一人的影子在墙上闪烁着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_12\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_5_bg_12.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_5_bg_12.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_5_bg_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声打破了店内的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很精致的糖果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我们使用这些欢迎逝者的归来，引导他们的灵魂在家中安息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>阿兹特克人认为，生命是一个周而复始的循环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>而死亡，它是生命的回照，是无限循环的一部分。我们死亡的方式，决定了我们灵魂的来世。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>那些在伟大战斗中牺牲的战士，他们的灵魂会伴随着太阳从塔洛坎宫殿升起，唱响凯歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645622.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645622.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-645622.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645622.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>直至四年之后，他们将转世成炫目的蝴蝶与蜂鸟，重返人间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您能告诉我，这些是真的吗，拉莫纳小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>你认识我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>莫雷洛斯区的孩子都把您叫做“能看见鬼魂的拉莫纳”。他们说，是您把小安娜那条意外逝世的无毛狗的灵魂找回家的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>在孩子们的口中，您无所不能，是阴影中的圣人，最了解这座城市的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>有人打探到，您出身于著名的通灵世家，只是脱离了家族——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这是一个谎言。我并不能看见鬼魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩漫不经心地反驳，止住了更多关于她身世的猜测。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>于我而言，鬼魂只是“灵”，一种无处不在的神秘学能量波动。它们存在着，和一缕微风没有什么区别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>人们只相信自己想要相信的东西，无论是小孩抑或是大人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>他们需要一个与逝者沟通的方式，来寄托自己的思念，因而期望我能看见鬼魂，能与他们说上话，替他们传达那些未能道出口的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>是啊……我很抱歉，拉莫纳小姐。这个问题只是一种强加的期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野木蓝的视线从对方身上夜巡特遣管理局的徽章移开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您这次前来，是有什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我确实有一些事情想要问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这个记号，对你来说应该不陌生吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>一支箭镞，一把猎弓，一张网状的袋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这是《奇马尔帕因手抄本》记载中，太阳神维齐洛波奇特利送给阿兹特克人的礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>也是绿松石蛇俱乐部的符号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>那个由神秘学家佩雷斯掌控的，墨西哥城最大的地下走私集团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>访客将布条收起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>你替佩雷斯工作，为俱乐部伪造神秘学名画。知道这件事的人并不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>大半个月前，佩雷斯的动作越来越大，明眼人都知道，他的野心在谋划更多的东西，而一场冠着“深邃、血腥的古老文明”名头的拍卖会就是最好的作秀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>看来这个城市中的一举一动都不能瞒过您的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这是来自夜巡特遣管理局的调查吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>执夜队？不，我才不在意那些穿制服的家伙在干些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我并非所谓的“正义之士”，不打算阻止这场拍卖会。再说了，这些根深蒂固的神秘学家黑帮可不是好惹的，这一点你应该比我更为清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>只是，这座城市最近的异象，在你所感受不到的地方正酝酿着——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-3_5_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-3_5_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-3_5_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>那些热闹街巷的阴影里，人们笑容的背后，废弃的空屋中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>“灵”的能量变得躁动不安起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>它们在午夜扭曲，盘旋在城市上空，尖啸着……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/Cg-3_5_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这是以前从来没有过的光景。再这样下去，我不确定会发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>是您的神秘学天赋在向您预警，即将到来的危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这算什么好天赋？特别是，当你出生于一个……所谓“通灵世家”的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对自己的出身，少女不愿多提，迅速跳过了这个话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>最近在城里甚嚣尘上的流言，接连五起的神秘学谋杀案，你不可能没有听说过。我怀疑“灵”的异常，正是和这起连环案件有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这个符号，是我在其中一个犯罪现场偶然发现的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>所以我要弄清楚，俱乐部和这起案件真正的联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>业余侦探收起了懒洋洋的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如果它们真的有联系——我是说，假如确实是绿松石蛇俱乐部所为，您会怎样做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>那就不是我该担心的事情了。那些穿着制服和皮鞋、戴着徽章的家伙们，接下来是他们的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您是一个热心的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野木蓝面上浮现了温和的笑意。那点笑意很快像一阵风一样消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>但很抱歉，拉莫纳小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如您所言，我既然替俱乐部工作，就无法为您提供任何的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>哪怕这份伪造的工作，并非是你自愿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>野木蓝，没记错的话，你以前是一名颜料商人，和黑帮也没有什么瓜葛。自佩雷斯大规模绑架、威胁墨西哥城中的画家之后，你才开始替他伪造名画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>和那些被绑架的画家一样，你不是自愿替俱乐部干活的。只是你更识时务一些，佩雷斯才没有把你一直关在俱乐部里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>如果能证实佩雷斯和这桩案件的关系，夜巡特遣会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>请回吧，我会对今天的对话保密的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩止住了话头，意识到自己方才的举动有些过于激动，甚至是愚蠢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>打扰你了，野木蓝。我该走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>亡灵节快到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>回去的时候，请带上一些装饰品吧，这样也不算白跑一趟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>你是个出色的推销员，即使在这种时候也不忘工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她嘲讽着接过对方递来的彩蜡烛，随手抛下两枚利齿子儿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的墓地，无人的空屋，破败的棺材，得以让疲惫的身心得到舒展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——本该是这样的才对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>拉莫纳小姐，你回来了！调查进行得还顺利吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>你去找的那个人——对方是你的朋友吗，还是你在城市中布下的眼线？我就知道这一切没有这么简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>……你怎么还在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>莱瑟姆小姐，我让你不要尾随我，并不是让你返回我的住所等我的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>我知道了！你一定是去找你认识的鬼魂了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我并不认识什么鬼魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我们在犯罪现场找到的那个符号，箭镞、弓与网，这是一个走私黑帮的代表符号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>绿松石蛇俱乐部……而我正巧认识一个被迫为它工作的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>原来如此，调查进展出乎意料地快，真是幸运！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>别高兴得太早了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>他不愿意为我提供俱乐部的信息，甚至还要我照顾他的生意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这个送你，就当你来一趟墨西哥的纪念品了。你该离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她百无聊赖地将买来的蜡烛抛给了对方，空脑袋手忙脚乱地接住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311216.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311216.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>哇——！这是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>一点小玩意儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的话头突然顿住。在充斥着孤魂与亡灵的荒郊墓地之中，蜡烛引起的神秘学波动尤为明显。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>等等。我改变主意了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>咦……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“纪念品”在她手上停留不过两秒，又被赠予的人收了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除灵师将彩蜡烛放在手心，再次仔细地端详着，随即，她将它收起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我要收回那句话——他对俱乐部或许没有那么忠诚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>这是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我会再给你买别的纪念品的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTSC-07"}}